Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Insolent brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:12.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will regret your recklessness !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Arrogant Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,how dare you harm an Elder of the Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and destroy our defensive formation !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1559,570)}Sun Leng\NSun Family Elder\NPeak Late stage\NSoul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(705,570)\fad(300,000)}Sun Huan\NSun Family Elder\NPeak Late stage\NSoul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(194,570)\fad(300,000)}Sun Xu\NSun Family Elder\NPeak Late stage\NSoul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you break your own arms and kneel in apology,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will spare your life for now !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I met this Elder Sun through a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,He obtained a flying sword and a bronze mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,through a trade with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you open his bag of holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can verify what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He coveted one of my artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and tried to kill me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,After I drove him back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,he fled all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's likely telling the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the Sun Family cannot tolerate a Junior running rampant !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter which family he is from,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:02:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will capture him with the Demon Sealing Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and wait for his Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,to decide whether he lives or dies !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seems the entire Sun Family is an accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,What cultivation level does this child have !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pressure far exceeds Soul Transformation !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could he be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,please calm your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1547,531)}Sun Qiming\NSun Family Grand Elder\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grand Elder !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ascendant Divine Sense ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun Family has offended you, fellow cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are willing to compensate for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please tell us what you want, fellow cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble my Juniors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,200 000 celestial jades
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the amount you requested is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are only a branch of the Sun Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, please wait 3 days
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow us to gather the celestial jades.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,He agreed rather quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Sun Family Ancestor is not magnanimous,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,then he must have ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Giving 200 000 celestial jades at once
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a terrible loss
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,even for the main family !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor personally ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to grant all his requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an order,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't allow what happened today to leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And never disturb this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anyone who causes trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be immediately banished
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,until a decision is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that I have tens of thousands of celestial jades on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to absorb them all as soon as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior of the Sun Family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare to stir up trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is most important for cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most important is diligence !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you lack talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you are diligent in your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you may still make progress one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guard this Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have seen many Core Formation, Nascent Soul and even Soul Formation cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I have never seen anyone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,that stops meditating to wander around the city in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fiend usually kills without blinking an eye
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he's letting a Junior lecture him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This scene is probably a once-in-a-millennium event !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must make sure to remember it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s not that I look down on you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,but in this cultivation world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:59.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,only the self-reliant can go far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have any questions about cultivation in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,you may ask me about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember to be diligent in your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't let you mind and body be lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may go in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this person’s cultivation is weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,compared to the deceit and treachery of the Alliance Star System,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,this isn't unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(198,508)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,After reaching Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating with celestial jades
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumes too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with the Sun Family’s 200 000 celestial jades,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't reach Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,To make a push for the second step,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the amount of celestial jades needed is unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe what the second step requires is not celestial jades,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,but something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Qiming of the Sun Family requests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 200 000 celestial jades have been sent from the main family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please Senior, check them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our last meeting was too short.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior still does not know your honorable name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 7 days, an auction will be held
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the Whole Treasure Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among the items,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,there will be a grade 8 pseudo-divine pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the invitation to the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reveal the information about the grade 8 pill to this person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to test him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pill is extremely effective for Ascendant cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:07:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he is interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,then he is just Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he will surely take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if he is not interested ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then his cultivation is above Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,must withdraw the Sun Family’s forces from the city
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to avoid any further involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kind of test
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not happen a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've come...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun Family invited me to the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kind of test feels strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:58.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can feel that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are afraid of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Afraid ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are indeed living in fear and dread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,have brought a huge disaster upon themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,4 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the space near Planet Ran Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sun Family Ancestor, Sun Xi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Carefree Xanren, Zhao Chuanwen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Ran Family Ancestor, Ran Xuefeng,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,joined forces
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,to ambush and kill a severely wounded cultivator who had fled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,They obtained 5 pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,5 grade 8 pseudo-divine pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But after the excitement,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside that person's bag of holding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,they found
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,a token from...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Thousand Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,A token of the Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The very Huan Family of Planet Thousand Illusions, the leader of the Northern Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know how the Huan Family acts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and how overbearing they are ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a family member is killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,all parties involved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter their identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have their entire family exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if the items from the dead person’s bag end up in someone else’s hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,merely possessing them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is likely to be seen as provocation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and trigger their wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That token
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and those pills
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all death sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once you’re stained by them, you can’t shake them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:38.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,These past 4 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,they have been walking on thin ice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and living in fear that one day
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Huan Family’s thunderous wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,will come for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this auction
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a bait
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,to hook me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this karma with the Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're trying to put me in the same boat as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,They want to atone for their crime
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,to avoid the extermination of their families
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,by framing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Huan Family investigates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,they will put all the blame on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,they'll use you as an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a clever scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,shifting the blame on others to have them do the dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ran Xuefeng...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Xi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhao Chuanwen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter will have too many consequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,A grade 8 pseudo-divine pill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,would at least allow me to directly reach Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,To reach Planet Dong Lin as soon as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must obtain this pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This trap might be sinister
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I must walk into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:54.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1516,491)}Huan Family Ancestral Home\NPlanet Thousand Illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That family member went missing 4 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:59.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308,503)\fad(300,300)}Huan Wuqing\NHuan Family Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are we only dealing with it now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,that person was merely a branch family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family has many members
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they're hard to track.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:08.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1564,503)}Huan Fengshen\NHuan Family Head
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have only learned of this matter recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, how do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should handle this matter ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can't ignore it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,All those involved
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be eradicated !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave this matter to Huan Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let her assign her own people to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to have her establish authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the Ancestor orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ever since the Ancestor went to the Alliance and brought back Huan Mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1766,543)}3 months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,he stopped dealing with affairs of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Mei will be this old man’s core disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the Ancestor went out of his way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to sacrifice his cultivation and use the blood exchange ritual on an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now he's helping her establish her authority in the family...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does he really intend to give the Huan Family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,to this woman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(304,498)}Attic\NHuan Family Ancestral Home
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Ran Yun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Dong,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(385,533)}Huan Dong\NHuan Family\NPeak Middle stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your cultivation has reached Peak Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This trip should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this is a minor matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's my first task for the Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must be dealt with quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Dong,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you understand ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The strongest cultivator on Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only at Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,On this mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make sure to exterminate all those involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not tarnish your reputation !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your subordinate takes his leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter must be handled splendidly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to win my lady’s favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:13.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(304,500)}East Sea\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to recent rumors among the Juniors,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:21.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Xu Mu is a Thunder Celestial Messenger
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has some connection to Planet Dong Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is truly unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has likely seen through our scheme
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and will not show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How precious is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,a grade 8 pseudo-divine pill ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:40.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,As an Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,who wouldn't go crazy for it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he took the invitation,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,all we need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to do everything we can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make him win the pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Temple and Planet Dong Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,are just talk among Juniors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,They may be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We went through all this trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but if this person isn't strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he ends up being useless when the Huan Family shows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can know what he's made of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a simple test.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,They've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,With such pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,could it be one of the Ancestors ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is here to cause trouble !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This residence is under my responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:49.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and as long as you are in this courtyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will ensure your safety !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:52.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're no match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about it !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,this place is a property of the Sun Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask what business Senior has here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior's name is Sun Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are very diligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may back down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as he is inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's Junior's duty to protect him !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's only a Core Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why must Senior deal with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was captured by that Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,He likely won’t survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have done all I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person’s cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he falls in the trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Ran Yun will survive this calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Sun Xi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean no harm to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,please don't be offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other day, you saved a junior of the Sun Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have prepared a small gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be honest, fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,the reason I have come
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to accompany you to the Whole Treasure Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to participate in the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish you success and hope you will gain from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Qiming greets the Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Senior Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he already knows it's a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did he still risk coming ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.36,0:18:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What background does this person have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be standing beside the Ancestor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the final item of this auction is a grade 8 pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its origin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is somewhat special.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pill does not come from our Planet Ran Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t like listening to stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I don’t tell you this story,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know that with Brother Xu's intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will have some doubts about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,the next item for auction is the final treasure of this event:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.28,0:19:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,A grade 8 pseudo-divine pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pill contains immense celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can only be endured by Ascendant cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If anyone below Ascendant forcefully consumes it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,their body will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Starting bid,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 celestial jades !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun Family has ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the auction of this item
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,must not be interfered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 3 family Ancestors are not using it themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,but putting it for auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter is inherently suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there any bidder ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If no fellow cultivator bids,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,the auction for this pill will end
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the pill will be temporarily available for sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:19:59.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will bid !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,One celestial jade.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:07.60,0:22:41.53,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}Reminder: Liu Mei's domain was the Thousand Illusions Ruthless domain that got transformed into the Thousand Illusions Lust Domain.\NHuan means illusion.\N\N"The glass-looking planet is planet Thousand Illusions. This is one of the five main planets of the Northern Domain of the Allheaven Star System. Mei'er, my Allheaven Star system cares a lot about bloodlines. Without the family bloodline, you won’t be able to practice higher level cultivation methods and won’t receive protection from the family.\N\N"From now on, aside from being my disciple, you are also my adopted daughter. Once I return to planet Thousand Illusions, I’ll cast the blood exchange ritual to change your bloodline. From then on you will no longer be called Liu Mei but Huan Mei! Do you agree?\N\N"Everything will go according to Master’s will."\N\N"This trip to Allheaven Star System is a new life for me… Wang Lin and everything that happened on planet Suzaku are now in the past. With his talent, he probably hasn’t even reached the Ascendant stage yet. Also, it isn’t even certain whether he can pass the life and death trial when breaking into the Ascendant stage."\N\N"He is probably still on planet Suzaku. Compared to me… he is no longer on the same level."
